PN,38801
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786522690
OL,3,CMan with Parkinson's unable to leave
OL,4,Cflat for five months after lift breaks
OL,6,F"It does feel as if I'm just a
OL,7,Fprisoner in here and nobody is really
OL,8,Fconcerned about it," says 82-year-old
OL,9,FIan Scott, who lives with Parkinson's.
OL,11,F"Just to walk down to Palmeira Square
OL,12,Fand the gardens down there, I mean
OL,13,Fit's lovely down there just to sit in
OL,14,Fthe sun, but no I can't even get
OL,15,Foutside the front door here."
OL,17,FMr Scott has been unable to leave his
OL,18,Fflat at Sandringham Lodge, in Hove,
OL,19,Ffor five months, after the building's
OL,20,Flift - which is the only way he can
OL,21,Freach the ground floor - broke.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786522690
OL,3,CMan with Parkinson's unable to leave
OL,4,Cflat for five months after lift breaks
OL,6,FHe told ITV Meridian he's unable to
OL,7,Fuse the stairs because of his
OL,8,Fcondition, while the handrails
OL,9,Finstalled on his floor do not provide
OL,10,Fas much grip as those found lower down
OL,11,Fin the building.
OL,13,FAustin Rees, which manages Sandringham
OL,14,FLodge, has called the matter
OL,15,F"technically complex" and that it's
OL,16,Fbeen made worse by "conflicting
OL,17,Fassessments" from contractors.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786522690
OL,3,CMan with Parkinson's unable to leave
OL,4,Cflat for five months after lift breaks
OL,6,FMr Scott said the situation has left
OL,7,Fhim unable to attend doctors
OL,8,Fappointments and checkups for his
OL,9,FParkinson's.
OL,11,F"I worry the whole time about not
OL,12,Fbeing able to get out and I've already
OL,13,Fhad one department at the hospital
OL,14,Fthat have said if I cancel another
OL,15,Fappointment they're going to discharge
OL,16,Fme.
OL,18,F"Well my GP stepped in there and said
OL,19,F'You can't do that.' He said 'It's not
OL,20,Fhis fault that he's missed all of
OL,21,Fthese appointments.'"
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786522690
OL,3,CMan with Parkinson's unable to leave
OL,4,Cflat for five months after lift breaks
OL,6,FAsked if he thinks he will ever be
OL,7,Fable to leave his flat again, Mr Scott
OL,8,Fjoked that he "might celebrate
OL,9,FChristmas extra hard", were it to
OL,10,Fhappen before the end of the year.
OL,12,F"Hopefully if I can bring enough
OL,13,Fpressure to bear then they will do
OL,14,Fsomething sooner rather than later."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786522690
OL,3,CMan with Parkinson's unable to leave
OL,4,Cflat for five months after lift breaks
OL,6,FAustin Rees said in a statement that
OL,7,Fit has "every sympathy" for all
OL,8,Fresidents affected by the disruption,
OL,9,Fadding that it recognises the
OL,10,F"significant impact this is having,
OL,11,Fparticularly on those with mobility
OL,12,Fdifficulties".
OL,14,F"This is a technically complex matter
OL,15,Fin which the contractors involved have
OL,16,Fprovided conflicting assessments of
OL,17,Fthe fault, the work required and
OL,18,Fresponsibility for the necessary
OL,19,Frepairs," the statement continued.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786522690
OL,3,CMan with Parkinson's unable to leave
OL,4,Cflat for five months after lift breaks
OL,6,F"An independent specialist has
OL,7,Ftherefore been appointed, and we are
OL,8,Fworking with the Right to Manage
OL,9,Fcompany to determine the correct, safe
OL,10,Fand financially viable route forward
OL,11,Fas quickly as possible.
OL,13,F"We are doing everything we reasonably
OL,14,Fcan to progress the matter, but do not
OL,15,Fwish to make promises about a
OL,16,Ftimescale until the required work and
OL,17,Fthe arrangements for completing it
OL,18,Fhave been fully determined in
OL,19,Fconsultation with the Right to Manage
OL,20,Fcompany."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
